3. 2D REGRET-RATIO MINIMIZING SET
We start by considering the two-dimensional scenario which, as
discussed in the introduction, not only has signiﬁcant theoretical
implications but also represents popular use cases in practice.
We show in Theorem 1 that the search space can be reduced to
the skyline tuples rather than in all ntuples in the database.
